<title>USA: St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Friday, were $0.50 higher. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   220-250 lbs    55.00</p>
<p>			 250-260 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>			 260-270 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3	   270-280 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>Sows - up $0.50-3.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    45.50-46.50</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    51.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
